    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59351b8970e4be4bede44227",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹成为了“祭典大将”。\n在几乎足以撼动地表的欢呼声下，她站在笑容的\n中心点，成为了大家喜爱的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c42aa8b7541e0f57196b08daa5acfcc9087e7ad5535a92019a15f260f6f70a76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
