    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893065d039a7fcb54971b9d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，蹄铁没问题，鞋带也换了！\n泥巴也都擦干净，变得亮晶晶的了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d94d55afd48823ebc7a43f1755ba99fead352ef875310a3f069b00c0fe769ee",
