      "uid": "zhcn:b73de8bf53964aa0bff751b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，\n最近小北每天都会认真保养鞋子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a8844c405b01c65a3003342b4596a9705c7a615c344a39c7419c5950bd9ddd",
