      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后要让训练员看到我又有更多的成长，\n让他吓一大跳！夸赞我──\n“持久力又比上礼拜进步了喔”！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5b73aa33e265ceba80c9b4f65f53aefe4f5a114431b7bbf11d179eb444f6b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
